# Build outputs only — the crate source, vendored boringtun/, Cargo.lock, and the
# committed xcframework under build/ are all tracked. target/ is cargo's scratch space.
/target/

# The repo-root .gitignore excludes any `build/` (Xcode output). Re-include this
# crate's build/ — the committed engine xcframework is the deliberate exception
# (D4 provenance: byte-compared against a from-source rebuild by the drift gate).
!build/
!build/**
